board/spacemit/k1: validation vehicle for the K1 DDR firmware

Hooks used by tools/vehicle/build-vehicle.sh on top of mainline U-Boot
8d534cec0cc: re-train test, open-firmware blob embedding, eMMC monitor,
software reset back to the BootROM, data_rate override and ymodem boot.
Licensed GPL-2.0-or-later, like U-Boot, so the files can live in its tree.

diff --git a/board/spacemit/k1/Makefile b/board/spacemit/k1/Makefile
